RPT_INFO @ 0 [DEMO] 
##########################################################################
# ARBITRATION STARVATION DEMO
#
# Setup: 4 requesters ALL ask for ONE shared resource EVERY cycle.
# The resource has a single port, so exactly one request is granted per cycle.
#
# STARVATION = the resource works and others keep getting it, but one requester
# never does. 'max_wait' == total cycles means 'never granted at all'.
##########################################################################
RPT_INFO @ 0 [DEMO] 
==========================================================================
 POLICY: FIXED priority (req 0 always wins)
==========================================================================
  Rule : the lowest index always wins.
  Risk : requester 0 asks every cycle, so requesters 1..3 are never even looked at.
         This is what 'a high-priority requester always wins' does to everyone else when
         that requester bids every cycle.
