==========================================================================
 POLICY: ROUND-ROBIN
==========================================================================
  Rule : a pointer rotates over the requesters, each gets its turn.
  Gain : perfectly fair, the wait is bounded by (requesters - 1) cycles.
  Cost : no priority at all - an urgent requester (e.g. the oldest request) waits like the rest.
