RPT_INFO @ 0 [DEMO] 
==========================================================================
 POLICY: FIXED + AGING
==========================================================================
  Rule : fixed priority, BUT a requester that has waited >= the age limit (8 cycles) is
         promoted ahead of the fixed order (longest waiter first).
  Gain : priority is kept (requester 0 still gets the most grants) and nobody starves:
         the wait is bounded by roughly (age limit + requesters).
  Watch: from cycle 9 on, requesters 1..3 age out one after another and get their grants.
RPT_INFO @ 0 [DEMO] narrating the first 12 cycles (waits = cycles since last grant)
